ADDITIONAL NOTE ON HARDWARE CONTROL

This software writes to your laptop's embedded controller through ACPI. It
raises the floor of the firmware's own fan curve and never disables the
firmware's thermal protection, and it includes a watchdog that returns control
to the firmware when temperatures climb. Even so, it is provided without
warranty of any kind, as stated above. Use it at your own risk.

